  "ruleText": "Par 203.07 Conclusion of the Hearing. After the board members, inmate, and witnesses have concluded their questions and/or comments, board members shall make a decision to grant or deny parole according to the criteria in Par 301.02 and Par 301.03.\n\nSource. #7149, eff 12-7-99, EXPIRED: 12-7-07\n\nNew. #9070, INTERIM, eff 1-11-08, EXPIRED: 7-9-08\n\nNew. #9254, eff 9-6-08; ss by #12157, eff 4-7-17 (from Par 203.08)",
